# Build outputs. Sources are tracked; everything a build regenerates is not.
#
# *.pdi, *.hwh and *.xsa are already ignored repository-wide.

# Device tree: sdtgen's scratch tree and the two files mkdtbo.py makes from it
dt_*/
*.dtbo
*.overlay.dts

# Vivado
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.ltx
*.backup.jou
*.backup.log
